you and I won't see it.

00:42:05.119 --> 00:42:06.830
The tightrope just looks
like a straight line,

00:42:06.830 --> 00:42:08.274
you only see that one dimension.

00:42:08.274 --> 00:42:09.934
But if you zoom in and
take the perspective

00:42:09.934 --> 00:42:11.801
