physics that we know about.

00:43:33.458 --> 00:43:35.462
And we know in our universe you can bend

00:43:35.462 --> 00:43:37.282
the fabric of space by
having a lot of energy.

00:43:37.282 --> 00:43:38.115
- You can bend the bread.

00:43:38.115 --> 00:43:38.948
- You can bend the bread by having

00:43:38.948 --> 00:43:40.123
a lot of mass, a lot of energy.

00:43:40.123 --> 00:43:41.254
That's what a black hole does.

00:43:41.254 --> 00:43:43.924
It creates a tunnel, an
indentation, if you will,

00:43:43.924 --> 00:43:45.237
in the fabric of space.

00:43:45.237 --> 00:43:46.889
So imagine you got a
black hole in that room,

00:43:46.889 --> 00:43:49.419
a black hole in this room,
and you indent the space

00:43:49.419 --> 00:43:51.386
in such a way that they join together

00:43:51.386 --> 00:43:53.879
