00:43:53.879 --> 00:43:55.869
Whether this could really work

00:43:55.869 --> 00:43:57.107
in this context I don't
know, but you could--

00:43:57.107 --> 00:43:58.312
- That's not what I'm asking you,

00:43:58.312 --> 00:43:59.250
