00:48:48.929 --> 00:48:52.380
Which means it has a nonzero
probability of happening,

00:48:52.380 --> 00:48:55.936
is represented in one of these worlds.

00:48:55.936 --> 00:48:57.800
- If there's an infinite number of worlds.

00:48:57.800 --> 00:48:59.092
