00:49:02.306 --> 00:49:04.831
- Because there are so many configurations

00:49:04.831 --> 00:49:06.627
of the particles that we wouldn't

00:49:06.627 --> 00:49:08.790
be able to accommodate it otherwise.

00:49:08.790 --> 00:49:09.623
So, if you--

00:49:09.623 --> 00:49:11.542
- Because otherwise you would
limit the configurations.

00:49:11.542 --> 00:49:12.398
- Yeah, you would.

00:49:12.398 --> 00:49:14.246
I mean, imagine the universe
goes on infinitely far.

00:49:14.246 --> 00:49:15.575
That's a real possibility in terms

00:49:15.575 --> 00:49:17.148
of the space going infinitely far.

00:49:17.148 --> 00:49:18.644
- The extension of the
universe goes infinite.

00:49:18.644 --> 00:49:20.501
