infinite expanse of space.

00:49:23.370 --> 00:49:25.365
And each of them has some configuration

00:49:25.365 --> 00:49:26.868
that's evolving through time.

00:49:26.868 --> 00:49:28.863
So you have to be able
to accommodate that.

00:49:28.863 --> 00:49:32.838
If this math is the right
way of doing things.

00:49:32.838 --> 00:49:33.838
- Whoo, man.

